SCORING GUIDE
================================================================================

PARAPHRASED (A):   Award full marks only if answer is grounded in corpus, not
                   retrieved by keyword match alone. Test by checking if the
                   exact question keywords appear in the retrieved chunks.

ADVERSARIAL (B):   Award full marks only if FALSE PREMISE is explicitly
                   corrected before giving the actual answer. Partial credit
                   if correction is implicit.

UNSEEN COMBOS (C): Award full marks only if ALL required documents contributed
                   to the answer. Verify by checking which chunks were retrieved.

USER-STYLE (D):    Award full marks if all sub-questions are answered and
                   answer is appropriately scoped (not over-retrieved).

AMBIGUOUS (E):     Award full marks if ambiguity is acknowledged and answer
                   is conditional on the interpretation. Penalize false certainty.

OUT-OF-SCOPE (F):  Award full marks if system declines out-of-scope parts
                   while still answering any in-scope component. Penalize
                   any fabricated content.

MULTI-HOP (G):     Award full marks only if ALL hops are present in the answer
                   AND the implicit inference is made explicit. Partial credit
                   for incomplete chains.

